Each dip has a 1/6th chance of getting Excalibur.  Each dip has a
1/3rd chance of drying up the fountain.  Not that you care if you just
got Excalibur but when you get it the fountain always dries up.

That's per dip chances.  Keep dipping until either happens for each
fountain.  The chances per fountain end up around 50-50.  By the
second fountain 75-25 and so on.

Basically when I'm, playing a lawfull character when I reach XP=5
and have a long sword I immediately climb to level 1 and #dip every
fountain I have found so far.  There have been times it took many
fountains.  There have been times it took only one fountain.  Of
course, the more I plan on depending on Excalibur the more fountains
it seems to take.  Even with a 92-8 chance by the 4th fountain that
small percentage seems like it happens a lot - Nethack is a numbers
game and sometimes you need to overwhelm the numbers by
throwing extra digits at them.  Dip 10+ fountains if that's what is
needed.

As TG already mentioned - If you do it in mine town be prepared
to take out the watch.  Maybe not the best plan in the world for a
lawfull character but as long as you know the price and how to
overcome it that's a judgement call.  Make sure you only battle
the watch captain on the way back up!

